{"args":{"resource":"observations/survey_cells.csv"},"client_id":"CL-B","entry_hash":"453bb4b289a6568c1a4be5c040db884944bad33b827269eb3199f1931abf9956","prev_hash":"bea2ea1dd30744fc6f0c4e581fd9f1f20caeb0552f5461e8eb2872afbe6a0c15","response":{"classification":"CLIENT-LICENSED","columns":["month","region","age_group","n","intenders"],"licensed_to":["CL-A","CL-B"],"note":"Region rows licensed per client: CL-A: Northeast, Midwest, South, West; CL-B: Northeast, Midwest, South","resource":"observations/survey_cells.csv","row_count":384},"response_sha256":"d8476efa7a4c98c8884dcb751c81ce3ac49d8ef40140e192878c63c33c1efd42","seq":7,"tool":"describe_resource","ts_utc":"2026-09-30T20:47:45Z"}
{"args":{"resource":"reference/methodology_summary.md"},"client_id":"CL-B","entry_hash":"0c7c295ce19104b71a5e34cfbf07cc70ae30de1f5b49043aa3d39bf01d88cf9e","prev_hash":"453bb4b289a6568c1a4be5c040db884944bad33b827269eb3199f1931abf9956","response":{"classification":"CLIENT-LICENSED","data":"# Methodology summary (client-visible)\n\n**Apparel Purchase Intent Survey.** A monthly online survey of about 3,000 U.S. adults, weighted to Census benchmarks. The headline measure, `intent_pct`, is the percent of adults planning to buy apparel in the next 30 days. Margins of error (`moe95_pts`) are 95% intervals that include a design effect for weighting. At the national level they are about ±2 points; for regions they are about ±3–5 points.\n\n**Spending Momentum Index (SMI).** A proprietary Halvorsen composite of survey intent and transaction-data signals, indexed to 100. The construction and weights are proprietary.\n\n**HX-APP forecast.** Halvorsen's proprietary model of U.S. apparel retail sales, year over year. The published outputs are point forecasts with 80% prediction intervals. Driver attributions show how much each input moved the forecast in the model. They are model attributions, not measured causal effects.\n\n**Brand trackers (custom).** Client-commissioned studies of brand consideration. Results belong to the commissioning client.\n","licensed_to":["CL-A","CL-B"],"resource":"reference/methodology_summary.md"},"response_sha256":"1e692ada1e2bfc80444df475fe5f15132bede704d14e23d1ca6b88cb1e5fae89","seq":8,"tool":"read_resource","ts_utc":"2026-09-30T20:47:45Z"}
{"args":{"resource":"reference/market_events.md"},"client_id":"CL-B","entry_hash":"6eccf202ee9c04d2d75739850257986ead307a55bb31eca47bd13fa90809711f","prev_hash":"0c7c295ce19104b71a5e34cfbf07cc70ae30de1f5b49043aa3d39bf01d88cf9e","response":{"classification":"CLIENT-LICENSED","data":"# Market events digest (client-visible; compiled by Halvorsen from public sources)\n\n- **2026-03** Regular gasoline prices rose for a third straight month (public EIA data).\n- **2026-04 to 2026-06** Several apparel chains, including Crestline, opened new stores across the South (trade press).\n- **2026-06** Northgate Outfitters launched \"Northgate Rewards\", a national loyalty program (company press release, June 2).\n- **2026-07** Back-to-school promotions started earlier than usual at several national retailers (trade press).\n- **2026-08** Consumer confidence proxies ticked up (public survey releases).\n","licensed_to":["CL-A","CL-B"],"resource":"reference/market_events.md"},"response_sha256":"8b63fc4c85b272f9ad362c1094726d7d158c41e8e024176199949ed2543970e9","seq":9,"tool":"read_resource","ts_utc":"2026-09-30T20:47:45Z"}
